\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Focus diagram. Top row: share of the 616 screened papers by dominant class. Middle: dominant classes reported for the neighbouring Langat and Selangor basins \cite  {ali25,zaki24,zaki23}. Orange: size windows of the UNM group's low- and high-resolution methods \cite  {ng24}. Bottom: counted range of the UNM Langat/Semenyih work, limited below by a 53\,\ensuremath  {\mu }m{} sieve \cite  {chen21a,chen23}; neither gives a size histogram. The shaded zone marks where the regional evidence concentrates.}}{4}{figure.caption.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:focus}{{3}{4}{Focus diagram. Top row: share of the 616 screened papers by dominant class. Middle: dominant classes reported for the neighbouring Langat and Selangor basins \cite {ali25,zaki24,zaki23}. Orange: size windows of the UNM group's low- and high-resolution methods \cite {ng24}. Bottom: counted range of the UNM Langat/Semenyih work, limited below by a 53\um {} sieve \cite {chen21a,chen23}; neither gives a size histogram. The shaded zone marks where the regional evidence concentrates}{figure.caption.4}{}}
